  "description": "AM1000-VX:\nAll-terrain full-suspension electric mountain bike, a powerful machine with a max speed of up to 35 mph and a long range of up to 70 miles per charge.\nA high-performance all-mountain eBike with throttle, offering power and versatility rarely found in other famous e-MTB brands.\nIf you like off road ebike adventure in nature, AM1000-VX is a perfect electric mtb strongly recommend you to pick.\n\nRide Beyond Limits with FREY VX\nThe Ultimate High-Performance eBike.\n\nUpgraded with a super powerful battery — no more range anxiety.\nFeatures\nUltra Bafang M620 G510:\nRated 1000w peak power 1500w mid-drive motor delivers max160Nm torque, easy to tackle steep climbs while off-road biking, it’s really a powerful e mountain bike.\n\nPower Function:\n\n1. Pure electric by throttle\n2. ECO/SPORT pedal assist\n3. 6km/h walk mode\n\nMixed Wheel\nMixed wheel design to meet different demands without effect on geometry performance, it supports\n\n29*160mm/27.5*160mm,\n29*160mm/29*160mm,\n27.5*180mm/27.5*170mm,\n27.5*160mm/26*160mm (only option for M size), act as S size.\n\nHigh Pivot Suspension Structure\nIncorporates a high pivot point suspension design, enhancing rear wheel traction and ground contact during rear wheel bumps. This provides a more stable body posture during downhill rides on bumpy surfaces.\n\nUpper idler\neffectively eliminates pedal kickback, maintaining higher pedaling efficiency.\n\nLower idler\nbetter tensions the chain and is accompanied by a chain guard, mitigating the risk of chain drop.\nAnti-squat\n\"Anti-squat\" means: When riding, the frame design effectively reduces or counteracts the compression of the rear shock absorber when the rider pedals. This prevents excessive compression of the rear shock absorber due to the rider's pedaling, maintaining a stable frame posture and suspension performance, thus enhancing riding efficiency and control. A smooth curve will bring excellent anti-squat effect, see Dopamine 2.0 curve below:\n\nRide with Freedom\nGlide through alpine trails, breathe the mountain air,and let every ride become part of your outdoor journey.\nhttps://youtu.be/aJsDuwTb3I8?si=cz8NOHe9aLP53mYa",
